WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.167
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.634
We hope you're
all doing well tonight.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.000
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.467
According to a new poll,
President Biden's

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:11.834
approval rating has risen
1 point over the last month.

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.801
So now he's going to keep
discovering more and more

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:19.234
classified documents
until he clinches re-election.

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:21.434
The FBI searched
President Biden's Delaware

00:00:21.434 --> 00:00:22.901
beach house yesterday
and reported

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:25.334
that they did not
find any classified documents.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.667
Of course not.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.267
You think that's what Joe Biden
reads at the beach?

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:33.534
It's Tom Clancy
or nothing down there.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:37.167
After facing criticism from
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis,

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:40.200
the College Board yesterday
released a revised framework

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.434
for its new A.P.
African-American Studies course,

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.133
which no longer
features sections on

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:49.133
reparations, prison abolition,
and black queer studies.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.701
Instead, students will just
watch "Friends."

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.667
At a House Judiciary Committee
meeting yesterday,

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.400
Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz proposed

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.567
that every meeting begin with
the pledge of allegiance,

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:06.033
just like they do
at his girlfriend's school.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:12.868
The New York groundhog
Staten Island Chuck

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:14.534
did not see his shadow today.

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:18.100
Said residents,
"Yeah, you didn't see nothin'."

00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:25.634
During this year's annual
Groundhog Day celebration,

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:28.367
Punxsutawney Phil predicted
another six weeks of winter.

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:31.634
Okay, but did he
see his shadow or a calendar?

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:35.200
Of course winter's not over.
It's February 2nd.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.234
There's still football.

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:38.467
Can we at least move
the stupid ritual

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:42.868
to mid-March,
where there's a little mystery?

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.334
The Federal Reserve raised
interest rates yesterday

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.033
by a quarter point,
which is going to make it

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:51.400
even harder to get approved
for a loan to buy eggs.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:56.033
The fast-food chain Subway
has announced

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:59.534
that it will begin slicing meat
in-store in front of customers.

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:02.467
And it can't be a good sign
when your customers' reaction

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:05.534
to your sandwiches is,
"Prove it."

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:11.133
"I'll wait."

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.133
Amid reports that the retailer
will file for bankruptcy,

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.701
Bed Bath &amp; Beyond
announced yesterday

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:20.400
it will close 87 stores
across the country.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.234
But, remember,
every time God closes a door,

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:26.133
he opens a Spirit Halloween.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.767
And, finally,
a 6-year-old in Michigan

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:33.567
recently ordered
about $1,000 worth of food

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:36.400
on a delivery app while
playing with his father's phone.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:40.234
Even more impressive,
his wife bought that story.

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:46.467
"I mean, I feel like I should
eat it since it's here."

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:48.300
That was the monologue,
everybody,

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.133
and it's off to the races.

